# Public Assets Folder

Files placed here will be served at the root `/`

## Image Organization:

```
public/
├── images/
│   ├── logo.png
│   ├── backgrounds/
│   └── photos/
├── fonts/
└── docs/
```

## Usage:

Reference files directly from your React components:

```jsx
// Image in public/images/
<img src="/images/logo.png" alt="Logo" />

// Background image
<div style={{ backgroundImage: 'url(/images/backgrounds/pattern.jpg)' }}>
  Content
</div>
```
